{"4775770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gelatinous Blob", "steam_appid": 4775770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4788310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a blob in this physics based marble platformer! Use physics based movement, tilting stages to complete stages and maximize scores. You must keep you blob together as best you can as you navigate tough challenges. Increase the force of gravity at anytime to sling your blob to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics based movement:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/7e788136546e340b3795a1f006bcc62c.poster.avif?t=1781218703\" aria-label=\"Blob sliding on tilted surface\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/7e788136546e340b3795a1f006bcc62c.webm?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/7e788136546e340b3795a1f006bcc62c.mp4?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt the stage to move the blob. With the press of a button increase the force of gravity to move faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blob Physics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/1652f7cb727690d0cb9e719a01da541e.poster.avif?t=1781218703\" aria-label=\"Blob bouncing\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/1652f7cb727690d0cb9e719a01da541e.webm?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/1652f7cb727690d0cb9e719a01da541e.mp4?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/be31a724e08136c6cd7765d8f4b8e0f6.poster.avif?t=1781218703\" aria-label=\"Blob splitting\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/be31a724e08136c6cd7765d8f4b8e0f6.webm?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/be31a724e08136c6cd7765d8f4b8e0f6.mp4?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blob is simulated. Allowing squishing, stretching, and breaking of the blob.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a blob in this physics based marble platformer! Use physics based movement, tilting stages to complete stages and maximize scores. You must keep you blob together as best you can as you navigate tough challenges. Increase the force of gravity at anytime to sling your blob to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics based movement:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/7e788136546e340b3795a1f006bcc62c.poster.avif?t=1781218703\" aria-label=\"Blob sliding on tilted surface\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/7e788136546e340b3795a1f006bcc62c.webm?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/7e788136546e340b3795a1f006bcc62c.mp4?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt the stage to move the blob. With the press of a button increase the force of gravity to move faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blob Physics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/1652f7cb727690d0cb9e719a01da541e.poster.avif?t=1781218703\" aria-label=\"Blob bouncing\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/1652f7cb727690d0cb9e719a01da541e.webm?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/1652f7cb727690d0cb9e719a01da541e.mp4?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/be31a724e08136c6cd7765d8f4b8e0f6.poster.avif?t=1781218703\" aria-label=\"Blob splitting\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/be31a724e08136c6cd7765d8f4b8e0f6.webm?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/extras/be31a724e08136c6cd7765d8f4b8e0f6.mp4?t=1781218703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blob is simulated. Allowing squishing, stretching, and breaking of the blob.</p>", "short_description": "Bounce, squish, and stretch apart the blob to complete challenging platforming. Tilt the stage and manipulate gravity to guide your blob.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/c0b4e3ffc3cc6e159a5e0e533d782cd4258d76df/header.jpg?t=1781218703", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/2f4f7e8c8a3e40782db164cd19ba67e44215faeb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781218703", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775770/2f4f7e8c8a3e40782db164cd19ba67e44215faeb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781218703", "website": "https://www.ryanseguin.ca/blob_game", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Recent Intel I5 or AMD Ryzen 5 Series or Better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Atleast 8 GB Graphics Card Compatable with Vulkan or DX12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Basically if your PC is better than a Steam Deck you should be able to run it</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Recent Intel I5 or AMD Ryzen 5 Series or Better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Atleast 8 GB Graphics Card Compatable with Vulkan or DX12</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ryan Seguin"], "publishers": ["Ryan Seguin"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 74, 